From cc769f4443fdbb7fb864452d3ae4bddcb2131331 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: heresy <heresy@local>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:36:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1014/1286] Three workspaces: Create, Write, Post
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HERESY 1014. Tabs in the top bar, kept per browser; the takes list stays in all
three, and the take picked there is the one Post works on.
- Create: the form and the take card, as the Kit has them.
- Write: the writing room at full size, with the song in the form beside it
  (title, style with its length, the score's K/M/Q, the lyrics), refreshed as
  the form changes and after a draft is applied.
- Post: what is done to a finished take — Spectrum and Lyrics check moved
  here from the card; Stems and AudioSR have their places. The take card has
  a Post row that opens this take there at that tool.
The spectrum only measures when it is on screen: a take picked in Create no
longer downloads a whole song in the background.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
